---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Privacy" description="Privacy information for Dealer AI Plugins and its skills-only plugin packages.">
  <article class="content-page">
    <div class="eyebrow"><span></span> Privacy</div>
    <h1>Transparent by design.</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Dealer AI Plugins distributes static, skills-only packages. This website does not require an account and the plugins do not include a hosted MCP server, authentication flow, tracking SDK, or database operated by Dealer AI Plugins.</p>
      <h2>Your data</h2>
      <p>Dealer Growth Hackers publishes Dealer AI Plugins. Information you provide while using an installed plugin is handled by the AI product and any tools you choose to connect. Do not provide passwords, API keys, payment information, or customer personal information unless the connected product and your dealership policies explicitly permit it.</p>
      <h2>Downloads and external links</h2>
      <p>ZIP downloads are served by Cloudflare. Links to GitHub, Dealer Growth Hackers, and other sites are governed by those services’ privacy terms.</p>
      <p>Last updated: October 1, 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
